==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pastry Cat (Enemy)|Pastry Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.
**1 [[Alpacky]] spawns.
**1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns.
**1 [[Xmas Pudding Cat (Enemy)|Xmas Pudding Cat]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Try to treat this stage like your run-of-the-mill Alien stage with both strong frontliners and annoying backliners. It's very difficult to stall at the beginning because of the buffed Ursamajor, so use [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]] to slow him so he doesn't push too hard (alternatively, a high level [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] can help stall and let you save up money for ubers or units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]). Stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] for the beginning while stalling for money. When you kill the Ursamajor, let your Cats die and lure to stack [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cats]], and if you can lure them close enough, then you can also try to stack [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]]. Once you hit the base, spawn [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|LD Cats]] like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] to kill I.M Phace and Corporal Weyland. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] can also assist them.

If one has him, [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] can completely decimate the traitless threats in this stage, being able to kill Pastry & Xmas Pudding Cat relatively quickly. (Be wary of your wallet, as if you're careless you can lose your money before you know it!)

